    "title": "Jimmy Kimmel's controversial return - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emma Cavanaugh ,\n16 days ago ABC has caved to political pressure, suspending late-night show host Jimmy Kimmel for deviating from the approved MAGA script. Predictably, conservatives were made irate over the “Jimmy Kimmel Live!” Sept. 15 episode, when Kimmel satirically pointed the finger at right-wingers for the horrific murder of Charlie Kirk. Kimmel was shunned by affiliates for his “ill-timed and insensitive” commentary, jeopardizing the state of his show. His suspension was a sign of the times: the end of free speech. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
